      "text": "-- The sum of a user's invoices.\nCREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION billing.user_total(uid bigint) RETURNS numeric\nLANGUAGE sql AS $$\n  SELECT sum((total).amount) FROM invoices WHERE user_id = uid;\n$$",
